=== failures: 1 ===
LIVE DRIVE FAILED

NOTE: the FAIL above is a setup collision, not a close of the wrong process.
Two `sleep 600` processes started in the same second have the same ps lstart
and the same command, so they share one identity digest. The follow-up drive
in live-reused-pid.log records a different command (`sleep 601`) as the
reject identity and leaves the live `sleep 600` holder and its terminal open.
